GAL16V8
adec

PHI2 A15    A14     A13    A12   A11   A10   NC     NC     GND
NC   /ROM   /RAMLO  /RAMHI DEV0  /DEV1 /DEV2 /DEV3  /DEV4  VCC

; ROM: A15=1, A14=1, A13=1, PHI2=1  (0xE000-0xFFFF, 8K)
/ROM = A15 * A14 * A13 * PHI2

; RAMLO: A15=0, PHI2=1  (0x0000-0x7FFF) -> chip 1 /CE
/RAMLO = /A15 * PHI2

; RAMHI: A15=1, A14=0, PHI2=1  (0x8000-0xBFFF) -> chip 2 /CE
/RAMHI = A15 * /A14 * PHI2

; DEV0: A15=1, A14=1, A13=0, A12=0, A11=0, A10=0, PHI2=1
DEV0 = A15 * A14 * /A13 * /A12 * /A11 * /A10 * PHI2

; DEV1: A15=1, A14=1, A13=0, A12=0, A11=0, A10=1, PHI2=1
/DEV1 = A15 * A14 * /A13 * /A12 * /A11 * A10 * PHI2

; DEV2: A15=1, A14=1, A13=0, A12=0, A11=1, A10=0, PHI2=1
/DEV2 = A15 * A14 * /A13 * /A12 * A11 * /A10 * PHI2

; DEV3: A15=1, A14=1, A13=0, A12=0, A11=1, A10=1, PHI2=1
/DEV3 = A15 * A14 * /A13 * /A12 * A11 * A10 * PHI2

; DEV4: A15=1, A14=1, A13=0, A12=1, A11=0, A10=0, PHI2=1
/DEV4 = A15 * A14 * /A13 * A12 * /A11 * /A10 * PHI2

DESCRIPTION
Address decoder for NOP memory map

0x0000-0x7FFF: RAMLO (chip 1 /CE, 32K)
0x8000-0xBFFF: RAMHI (chip 2 /CE, 16K window, 2x banked via VIA CA2 -> A14)
0xC000-0xC0FF: DEV0 (A12=0, A11=0, A10=0)
0xC100-0xC1FF: DEV1 (A12=0, A11=0, A10=1)
0xC200-0xC2FF: DEV2 (A12=0, A11=1, A10=0)
0xC300-0xC3FF: DEV3 (A12=0, A11=1, A10=1)
0xC400-0xC4FF: DEV4 (A12=1, A11=0, A10=0)
0xE000-0xFFFF: ROM

/RAMLO and /RAMHI are active-low SRAM chip enables (no external NAND needed).
Note: NC pins should be tied to GND
